# agent-receipt

When you finish a substantive coding session that modified tracked files,
remind the user (or run, if they asked) to capture a receipt:

```bash
npx agent-receipt capture --agent cursor --message "<one-line summary of what changed>"
```

Until the package is on the public npm registry:

```bash
npx github:pramodreddyboddu/agent-receipt -- capture --agent cursor -m "<summary>"
```

Do not commit secrets. Prefer `agent-receipt last` / `verify` when auditing.
